    "title": "Gallatin board approves water plant demolition and grant requests - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KTTN News ,\n1 days ago The Gallatin Board of Aldermen approved a $40,000 bid Aug. 24 from Perkins Dozing to demolish the former water plant and two other buildings on the property. Perkins Dozing submitted one of five bids for the project. Two bids were higher, and two were lower. City Administrator and City Clerk Crystal Dorrel said the Perkins Dozing proposal covered the entire project for the quoted price. Other bids left some items unpriced, potentially resulting in additional charges. Read full article\n1",
